  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-05-23T23:57:25-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, May 23, 2017, 11:57 pm\">May 23, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_2686\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><img class=\"size-medium wp-image-2686\" src=\"/media/archive/a62d00f5582bdfcbca556fd197d90cec15d35d2a1cae46787d00347339270a70.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"241\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2686\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">© M. Little Fuentes, The Oboist. Oil on Canvas, 11 x 14 inches.</figcaption></figure>Guild of Harwich Artists member, Martha Little Fuentes, will exhibit ‘The Oboist’, in the Cultural Center of Cape Cod’s new exhibit <em>Face The Music</em>, an exhibit of work featuring musicians by multiple artists. Opening reception on Friday, May 26 from 5-7 pm. <em>Face The Music</em> runs through June 4.<p></p>\n<p>The Cultural Center of Cape Cod<br />\n307 Old Main Street<br />\nSouth Yarmouth, MA 02664<br />\nphone: (508) 394-7100</p>\n<p>HOURS<br />\nMonday through Friday: 9am-5pm<br />\nSaturday: 11am-5pm<br />\nSunday: noon-5pm<br />\nEvery evening, by chance.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-bc2e4bef39a39f9eb9e9/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY ARTISTS</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-6e9041272e0af8b4ebb7/\" rel=\"tag\">Cape Cod</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-cad862c10cd96fd1b6c5/\" rel=\"tag\">Cultural Center of Cape Cod</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-c5a0664c0f5b2d29d271/\" rel=\"tag\">Guild of Harwich Artists</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-55e09a88f1feffe4fd22/\" rel=\"tag\">Martha Little Fuentes</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
